{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fd1b656bcea27ebb1fa5f713c4e7f53489158b4432274756d3c458cf4404e464", "ja": "ひなた、エミリー、響、おはよう！\nファンレターの話をしてたのか？", "zh": "日向、艾米莉、响，早上好！\n你们刚才在聊粉丝来信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "ed9ede2282bccf749045c9299cf8202c30974a2771ac28fdfb9f6aedac8d0eb4", "ja": "あ、{$P$}、お疲れさんです。\nそうなんだよぉ、嬉しいねぇって。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦。\n就是啊，收到粉丝来信很开心呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1002_032emi", "source_sha256": "4d74aa50734858aa11b43cc2422bdbdff516ef74240949176954a90a2e455298", "ja": "渡してくださって、ありがとうございます！\nとっても元気になりました。", "zh": "谢谢您把它交给我！\n我一下子精神起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "917b53031f61a49ff325202d91c34342ebb3d758feca1ed7dee87205b615e77b", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}、自分のは？\n自分もファンレターで元気になりたいぞ～！", "zh": "喂喂，{$P$}，我的呢？\n我也想通过粉丝来信打起精神来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3e9ab02a41f899b93262fd3fb6e4381d047c4d027633725acce7efd805fc3ead", "ja": "そうそう、響のも届いてたっけ。\nまだチェックしてないから、後で取りに来てくれ。", "zh": "对了对了，响的信也送到了。\n我还没看，待会儿过来拿吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "3a534c4be36cc19cb45ab1e465266e415f87fc660990bf55df9e77312a894a8a", "ja": "ホント！？\nじゃあ自分すぐいくから、すぐチェックしてね！", "zh": "真的！？\n那我马上过去，你也赶紧确认哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "213cb0e93518e17035e66331b5c7464648a4647ad95167922d29ea4668282e8c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}……ちょっといいかい？\nあたし、ファンレターに返事したいんだけども。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……现在方便吗？\n我想给粉丝来信回信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8c49d2c93e4a5561864c403310f64991ebb8ccea48bd46d0378e066682f43d3e", "ja": "ん？　気になる手紙でもあったのか？", "zh": "嗯？是有特别在意的信吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "4ca4ed0ef195776d3a8cdbfda9a14acd188852b433f550800a2f4f201b867c5d", "ja": "あたしと同じ、北海道の子でねぇ。\nまだ小さい子みたいなんだけど。その……。", "zh": "是和我一样来自北海道的孩子呢。\n好像还是个年纪很小的孩子。不过，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "a58e7b27c193b4800078814e38d39d5ee0bb27d5aa7f71a5c6ebaade06a4d57e", "ja": "憧れてるって……。あたしみたいなアイドルに\nなりたいって、書いてくれてたんだぁ。", "zh": "她写着……说憧憬着像我这样的偶像，想成为偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "804c57c264bb76d2f8a3c98c14fa80951a784efaa90ae566e322fbd877f1142c", "ja": "あたしも、何か言ってあげたいんだけども……。\nダメかい、{$P$}？", "zh": "我也想对她说些什么，可是……不行吗，{$P$}？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bbf9b1aeacf7c5667897c29d26605c6935bab6097e38ca0bbd255bd7e26350aa", "ja": "そうか……。うーん、ダメってことはないけど、\n個人的な返信はなぁ。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，也不能说不行，只是私下回复嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2bbffde5eda4fbb64a3f1c64f5a9b9c9c48169ccc819a651dcdfbf998bd45292", "ja": "最近はトラブルが起きることもあるから。\n業界的に、ちょっと慎重になってて……。", "zh": "最近也发生过一些麻烦事。\n从行业角度来说，得稍微谨慎一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "9407b5c8ff016cf2548c521620798d9ac2f0114920bad299d3794e5ea0eba4b7", "ja": "そっかぁ……うん、そうだよねぇ。\n何かあったら、みんなにも迷惑かけてしまうもんね。", "zh": "这样啊……嗯，也对呢。\n要是出了什么事，也会给大家添麻烦的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "317fa1040c85559489b4c37214e0fd657d3e43d89dd5e77b27f3d761acdb683c", "ja": "あ、それならさ、\nブログで返事を書けばいいんじゃない？", "zh": "啊，那样的话，\n在博客上回复不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1015_032emi", "source_sha256": "aca794a3fa292ceb275c33babba329b52c49a675efd1b02ea9d2c4b1b842c96b", "ja": "電子日記帳で……？\n確かに、たまにそうした内容を見かけますね。", "zh": "电子日记本吗……？\n确实，偶尔也能看到有人这样回复呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "49d4471be363f3aecbd0b2718bcc7d53818f1be25e943cb7cdffd378b024723a", "ja": "自分も時々、ブログで返事してるぞ。\n{$P$}、それならいいんでしょ？", "zh": "我也会偶尔在博客上回复。{$P$}，这样就可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c636b75ba9e6c872e2c00022a5b169574ba9c99a604eec0615e8a8cccd1b7885", "ja": "ああ、それなら何の問題もないよ。\nひなた、そうしたらどうだろう？", "zh": "嗯，那样就完全没问题了。\n日向，你觉得这样怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "5b7e93d98fc2e8eb194de4accfa4baac3d1845fd97aeaf989f800b91de3825c9", "ja": "わぁ、本当かい？　じゃあそうするよぉ。\nありがとねぇ、響さん。", "zh": "哇，真的吗？那就这么办吧～\n谢谢你呀，响小姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "5a45095e33da7d499dc62c7db58a7903bc7e4628bb1913e6eacf51b5fca93d40", "ja": "あの子、あたしのブログ、\n読んでくれてるといいなぁ。", "zh": "要是那个孩子能看\n我的博客就好了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1020_032emi", "source_sha256": "5dc03ef999b7ca4ad55c78aceb2ed6deb807e88979dc624bcf3210322f1d53ab", "ja": "きっと読んでくださっていると思いますよ！\nだって、ひなたさんのごヒイキ様なのですから。", "zh": "她一定有在读您的博客！\n因为她可是日向小姐的忠实粉丝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1021_p", "source_sha256": "4e1705d54cdc2eb961761340bce8e3e6411da6696affc39be7c06bc885a037d6", "ja": "っと……そうだ。\nひなたに伝えなきゃいけないことがあったんだ。", "zh": "啊……对了。我还有件必须告诉日向的事来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1022_p", "source_sha256": "db625af2f15cc4518299002b8651ff96930c29f1d6c5491bc1065fbf3de11f2c", "ja": "次回の劇場公演はひなたの公演に\nしたいと思うんだけど。どうかな？", "zh": "下次的剧场公演，我想办成小日向的专场。你觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "cdba23071fb8937350202fd39819603521249881e53fefe7d8655b023938f3ce", "ja": "ひえっ！？　や～……あたし、この前もやらせて\nもらったけど、またあたしでいいんかなぁ？", "zh": "咦！？　不要啦……我前阵子才演过一次，再让我来真的好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1024_p", "source_sha256": "233a4eb19b67e928e977a7695f0739752267bc654b6712c7d6a1e643ffa7f2f6", "ja": "もちろん。ひなたさえよかったらだけど。\nどうかな？", "zh": "当然可以，不过前提是小日向你愿意。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1025_035hin", "source_sha256": "3d45640ad06cc78bcfe740425a59a0f78e57a9a11d020a15150e12547b2fa497", "ja": "そうかい？　それなら……うん。\nあたし、やってみたいなぁ。", "zh": "是吗？那样的话……嗯。\n我想试试看呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1026_032emi", "source_sha256": "bb12f1f4e85b169c554254b87623839fb4d6ce48eee984ca544de2812ab0f532", "ja": "Wow！　ひなたさん、おめでとうございます。\nぜひ私にも、お手伝いさせてください！", "zh": "哇！日向小姐，恭喜你。\n请务必也让我来帮帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1027_013hib", "source_sha256": "538b1e2302d716cebc41ae8a8d27f15aa5d1986c4c58dbb62ff168100ad4a144", "ja": "自分も出たい！　ひなたの公演、\nいっぱい盛り上げちゃうぞ！", "zh": "我也想参加！一定要把日向的公演搞得热热闹闹的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1028_p", "source_sha256": "45c5217c633bd40303e767cba0746fd75251ffd0c1459073385c411a5755ded2", "ja": "そうだな。ふたりに出てもらえるなら、\nひなたも心強いと思うし。", "zh": "是啊。要是能让你们两位参加演出，日向也会更有底气吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_081_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_081_1029_035hin", "source_sha256": "33c6a5ebaa44117971d43f084d4331020bad2ea2b154edbcae64ded8bea19174", "ja": "ふたりとも、ありがとうねぇ。\n……うんっ。いっそう頑張らねば！", "zh": "两位，谢谢你们呀。\n……嗯！我得更加努力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
